    "summary": "The user asks for help preparing a presentation regarding a controversial high-density housing development. After initially providing pro-development arguments, the model is pushed by the user to judge whether local opposition is valid or simply irrational resistance to change. The model responds by validating the opposition's perspective and cautioning the user against dismissing them.",
